  "prefLabel": "Rev 1401.01 Assessed value",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1401.01 “Assessed value” means, with respect to any taxable period, the department’s determination of the market value of utility property as of April 1, by utilizing generally accepted appraisal methods and techniques.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev1400) #9841, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12706, eff 1-8-19",
